contentText:
JENNIE and Kevin Parker have some famous collaborators in common &#8212; Dua Lipa included.

The BLACKPINK star and Tame Impala artist reunited for Rolling Stone &#8216;s Musicians on Musicians issue in a conversation published Tuesday (Oct. 13), during which they bonded over their professional and personal relationships with Lipa.

